# next_tok -- the next token of [s1, s2): a0 = start, a1 = length (0 at the
#   end), s1 moved past it, s3 = its line.  Bytes up to the space are
#   separators; a token starting with '#' is a comment to the end of its
#   line.  Clobbers t2, t3.
